# cuentas-admin@v1 — Parte de acceso

## 1. Identity and traceability

**Draft; not approved for implementation.** David selected Parte de acceso (a), r13, through the web comparison. Selection authorizes finalization of these two planning artifacts, not approval of the contract or plan. This replaces the previous unapproved v1 canonical draft. T2.1 may copy the exact independently approved snapshot to `design/contracts/cuentas-admin@v1.md` only after approval. Explorations, history, SPEC, PLAN and production files remain untouched.

